
# Deceptive Opportunity Detector

## Problem
Students receive fake job emails like Unibase asking passport + $200 fee + crypto wallet before interview.

## Solution
Python tool check_email(text) that detects fee, crypto wallet, urgent payment, guaranteed visa and explains why.

## Setup
git clone https://github.com/engtabarak2026-hue/-deceptive-opportunity-detector-
python detector.py

